    "message": "Condition PNR sampling on exact totals and prune impossible degrees\n\nAdd C++ strict and explicit-budget number samplers; preserve v1 resource failure. Validate 2M fresh quality records, 36 matched PNR/direct/Frugal timing panels, and 100k strong-input collision records.\n\nRetain strong-input correlation error and separate positive target-tail correction. No arbitrary-energy or global floating-point certification claim.\n\nValidation: 4478 independent checks; 900 tests run, 871 passed, zero failures/errors; eight new interface tests.",
